  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "高定衬衫与耍大牌  (Couture Shirt Gossip and a Rude Idol)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xiaoye": "小叶"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back at Xingtian, Xingzi and Kaiwen gossip cheerfully about Chun Yuqiao's romantic couture shirt and mellower temper—until Xiaoye storms over in fury after an encounter with the agency's replacement idol. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看到他里边穿的衬衫了吗？那是高定的，中国买都买不到。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "辛惠美是这个品牌的代言，特权呗。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "看来昨天晚上还挺浪漫的，从来不迟到的魔鬼鱼都起晚了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他跟辛惠美过得越幸福，咱们的日子可就越好过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你有没有发现，最近他发脾气可少了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "凭什么呀？这件衣服我不要了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "怎么了，小叶？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "那贾喆上午手脏了，他伸手就往我衣服上抹！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "就这素质还艺人呢？谁都是父母养的！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他现在可是那边经纪公司的一哥。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "什么一哥？我不伺候了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你别跟小孩似的，别生气了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看到他里边穿的衬衫了吗？那是高定的，中国买都买不到。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you spot the shirt he is wearing underneath? It is haute couture you cannot even buy in China.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "辛惠美是这个品牌的代言，特权呗。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xin Huimei is the brand ambassador—talk about special perks.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "看来昨天晚上还挺浪漫的，从来不迟到的魔鬼鱼都起晚了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Looks like last night was pretty romantic—even never-late Manta Ray overslept.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他跟辛惠美过得越幸福，咱们的日子可就越好过。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The happier things go between him and Xin Huimei, the easier life gets for all of us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你有没有发现，最近他发脾气可少了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you noticed how much less often he loses his temper lately?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "凭什么呀？这件衣服我不要了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What gives him the right? I do not even want this jacket anymore!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "怎么了，小叶？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened, Xiaoye?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "那贾喆上午手脏了，他伸手就往我衣服上抹！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That Jia Zhe got dirt on his hand this morning and wiped it straight onto my coat!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "就这素质还艺人呢？谁都是父母养的！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Calling himself an artist with manners like that? Every one of us was raised by loving parents!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "他现在可是那边经纪公司的一哥。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right now he is that partner agency's leading man.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "什么一哥？我不伺候了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Leading man my foot—I refuse to wait on him!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你别跟小孩似的，别生气了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not get worked up like a kid—calm down.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
